{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人陳豪日前突擊到自家精品咖啡店巡視，還帶菠蘿包「萬歲」。</p><p>事後他在社交網分享短片，笑言是「突擊檢查」，又親手炮製招牌棉花糖拿鐵，由打奶泡、拉花、擠棉花糖忌廉，再用火槍炙燒表面，手勢熟練又專業，他笑說：「身為稱職嘅老闆，應該忙完宣傳之後去突擊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T16:17:12.514760+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T16:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T16:10:22.609990+00:00","content_hash":"6e0691551e356f4667003a90dc348dff0911bbce55139ce60bee78ffa2b17f5b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}